{"title":"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 15","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>How many four-digit multiples of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/8455f3b5cb3b4880b8c9d782a5c1f0334db819eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> are greater than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/b/c/abc1744a459ad135efd3fd45fca7285cae133717.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2008$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"38\" height=\"14\" />? \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can make a list of four-digit multiples of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/8455f3b5cb3b4880b8c9d782a5c1f0334db819eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> that are greater than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/f/5/8f51a518287f50b7915f25a2d0ac56aa14cb3383.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2008.$\" width=\"39\" height=\"12\" /> The smallest multiple of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/8455f3b5cb3b4880b8c9d782a5c1f0334db819eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> that is larger than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/b/c/abc1744a459ad135efd3fd45fca7285cae133717.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2008$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"38\" height=\"14\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/b/e/3be0db8be7381c6ed6609c8a81519d9d445960ff.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2016,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"40\" height=\"16\" /> so we can start with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/9/3/e930d13b9a58f1a4b7e603a80566b46bc3663036.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2016.$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"39\" height=\"13\" /> The largest four-digit multiple of 8 is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/d/1/fd1376df591931c0499cf9f8e445161aae820a4c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9992.$\" width=\"39\" height=\"12\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/e/3/5e30b0eb8a2834729669204256c6e23306db53f9.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[2016, 2024, 2032,  ..., 9984, 9992\\]\" width=\"236\" height=\"16\" />\nDivide everything in the list by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/8/fa858061118ca73466354e93abe34aeb9d97a076.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8:$\" width=\"17\" height=\"12\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/c/8/1c8e357d93239eaa1fbb7d67ec115ac22587e38b.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[252, 253, 254, ..., 1248, 1249\\]\" width=\"208\" height=\"16\" />\nNow subtract <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/3/f/93f1c4193e8c21c6384954b4b13d24d9ddcf0933.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$251$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"26\" height=\"13\" /> from every member of the list.\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/e/f9e8501c2681e9d37a8a66757221aa6294114084.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[1, 2, 3, ..., 998, 998\\]\" width=\"135\" height=\"16\" />\nThere are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/9/1/4914eeac89c1525c3550da96c0efba02a7f0d836.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$998$\" width=\"26\" height=\"12\" /> numbers in this list, so there are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/f/2/df2ec53b772c9e2b8f1c7339c9a210135e8bbe33.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{998}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"40\" height=\"25\" /> four-digit multiples of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/8455f3b5cb3b4880b8c9d782a5c1f0334db819eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> that are greater than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/f/5/8f51a518287f50b7915f25a2d0ac56aa14cb3383.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2008.$\" width=\"39\" height=\"12\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/3/4/6344c7c594cd12d58b16909eb2c65af5170b7953.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[2008 &lt; 8k &lt; 10000 \\implies251 &lt; k &lt; 1250 \\implies252 \\le k \\le 1249\\]\" width=\"491\" height=\"15\" />\nTherefore there are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/5/f/d5fd35736ff929ebbecda3002a89fed5f0b9239b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1249-252+1=998$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"171\" height=\"15\" /> possible values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" /> and consequently <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/f/2/df2ec53b772c9e2b8f1c7339c9a210135e8bbe33.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{998}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"40\" height=\"25\" /> possible four-digit multiples of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/8455f3b5cb3b4880b8c9d782a5c1f0334db819eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> satisfying the inequality.\n</p><p>~ <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/b/b/abbaa2d63b4b0621e038e82904fb55f2b59eadbd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathbb{N}\\text{oo}\\vec{\\text{r}}\\,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"41\" height=\"15\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest\" title=\"2008 iTest\">2008 iTest</a> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems\">(Problems)</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by:<br /><b><a href